gloss":"daylight"},{"text":"இன்று","lemma":"iṉṟu","gloss":"is devoid of"}],"gloss":"has set"},{"surface":"பாடும்","parts":[{"text":"பாடு","lemma":"pāṭu","gloss":"sound"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"the sound too"},{"surface":"கேளாய்","parts":[{"text":"கேள்","lemma":"kēḷ","gloss":"hear"},{"text":"ஆய்","lemma":"āy","gloss":"you"}],"gloss":"listen"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"செல்லாதீமோ","parts":[{"text":"செல்லாது","lemma":"cellātu","gloss":"without going"},{"text":"ஈமோ","lemma":"īmō","gloss":"please (imperative particle)"}],"gloss":"do not go"},{"surface":"சிறுபிடி","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"ciṟu","gloss":"small"},{"text":"பிடி","lemma":"piṭi","gloss":"female elephant"}],"gloss":"small female elephant"},{"surface":"துணையே","parts":[{"text":"துணை","lemma":"tuṇai","gloss":"companion"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"O"}],"gloss":"O companion"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வேற்றுமுனை","parts":[{"text":"வேற்று","lemma":"vēṟṟu","gloss":"hostile"},{"text":"முனை","lemma":"muṉai","gloss":"borderland"}],"gloss":"hostile borderland"},{"surface":"வெம்மையில்","parts":[{"text":"வெம்மை","lemma":"vemmai","gloss":"harsh heat"},{"text":"இல்","lemma":"il","gloss":"due to"}],"gloss":"due to the harsh heat"},{"surface":"சாத்து","parts":[{"text":"சாத்து","lemma":"cāttu","gloss":"merchant caravan"}],"gloss":"merchant caravan"},{"surface":"வந்து","parts":[{"text":"வந்து","lemma":"vantu","gloss":"having arrived"}],"gloss":"having arrived"},{"surface":"இறுத்தென","parts":[{"text":"இறுத்து","lemma":"iṟuttu","gloss":"having camped"},{"text":"என","lemma":"eṉa","gloss":"since"}],"gloss":"since they camped"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வளையணி","parts":[{"text":"வளை","lemma":"vaḷai","gloss":"metal band"},{"text":"அணி","lemma":"aṇi","gloss":"adorned with"}],"gloss":"adorned with metal bands"},{"surface":"நெடுவேல்","parts":[{"text":"நெடு","lemma":"neṭu","gloss":"long"},{"text":"வேல்","lemma":"vēl","gloss":"spear"}],"gloss":"long spear"},{"surface":"ஏந்தி","parts":[{"text":"ஏந்தி","lemma":"ēnti","gloss":"holding"}],"gloss":"holding"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மிளை","parts":[{"text":"மிளை","lemma":"miḷai","gloss":"protective forest"}],"gloss":"protective forest"},{"surface":"வந்து","parts":[{"text":"வந்து","lemma":"vantu","gloss":"coming"}],"gloss":"coming"},{"surface":"பெயரும்","parts":[{"text":"பெயரும்","lemma":"peyarum","gloss":"patrolling"}],"gloss":"patrolling"},{"surface":"தண்ணுமைக்","parts":[{"text":"தண்ணுமைக்","lemma":"தண்ணுமைக்","gloss":"of the taṇṇumai drum"}],"gloss":"of the taṇṇumai drum","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"குரலே","parts":[{"text":"குரல்","lemma":"kural","gloss":"sound"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"the sound indeed"}]}],"literal":"The sun too has set. Listen to the sound! / Do not go, O companion of the small female elephant! / Since a merchant caravan has arrived and camped due to the harshness of the hostile borderland, / holding long spears adorned with metal bands, / coming to the protective forest and patrolling, is the sound of the taṇṇumai drum.","translation":"The sun has set. Listen to that sound! Do not go forward, O companion of the small female elephant! Because a merchant caravan has arrived and camped here to escape the harshness of the hostile borderlands, the guards, holding long spears adorned with metal bands, patrol the protective forest, and the sound of their taṇṇumai drums reverberates.","modern":"சூரியனும் மறைந்துவிட்டது. அந்த ஒலியைக் கேள்! சிறிய பெண் யானையின் துணையே, மேலே செல்லாதே. பகைமை நிறைந்த எல்லையின் கொடுமையால் வணிகர் கூட்டம் இங்கு வந்து தங்கியிருப்பதால், வளையங்கள் அணிந்த நீண்ட வேலேந்தி, காவற்காட்டில் வந்து உலாவிப் பாதுகாக்கும் காவலர்களின் தண்ணுமைப் பறையின் ஒலி அது!","explanation":"This poem is set in the arid Pālai landscape, where bystanders observe a young couple eloping through a dangerous desert path. They address their warning to a male elephant, which serves as a poignant metaphor for the young hero accompanying his delicate bride. The bystanders point out that the sun has already set and a loud drumbeat can be heard in the distance. This sound belongs to the taṇṇumai drums of guards who are patrolling the protective forest-border to secure a merchant caravan that has camped there. Since these armed guards carry long, metal-banded spears and patrol actively, the path ahead is highly unsafe. By advising the elephant to halt, the bystanders kindly warn the young lovers to stop their journey for the night and avoid danger.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.6],[0.6,1.2],[1.2,1.5],[1.58,1.88],[1.88,2.42],[2.5,3.0],[3.0,3.4],[3.4,4.5],[4.5,4.9],[4.9,5.29],[5.29,6.0],[6.0,6.8],[6.8,6.8],[6.8,7.3],[7.3,8.6],[8.6,8.9],[8.9,9.48],[9.48,9.8]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.3],[1.3,1.7],[1.7,2.7],[2.7,3.0],[3.0,3.7],[3.7,4.1],[4.1,5.3],[5.3,5.42],[5.42,5.77],[5.77,5.88],[6.0,7.9],[7.9,8.0],[8.0,8.5],[8.5,10.0],[10.0,10.4],[10.4,10.93],[10.93,11.23]]}}